menu "Korvo monitor"

config KORVO_EMBED_SPEECH
    bool "Embed operator-supplied speech samples"
    default n
    help
        Embed the ten PCM files described in main/speech/README.md and seed
        missing samples on the SD card. These files are not distributed.
        When disabled, existing SD samples can still play; missing samples
        fall back to the event tone.

endmenu
